\ === errors ===
square [ [ 0 1 2 3 ] ] [ 0 0 10 ] 1 3 matrix [ 0 0 -1 ] 1 3 matrix [ 0x808080 ] vector [ 0 ] vector projection projection sunlit fill-solid  \ (a camera not 4x3)
square [ [ 0 1 2 3 ] ] [ 0 0 10 ] 1 3 matrix [ 0 0 -1 ] 1 3 matrix [ ] vector [ 0 ] vector straight-on projection sunlit fill-solid         \ (no colour for the face)
square [ [ 0 1 2 9 ] ] [ 0 0 10 ] 1 3 matrix [ 0 0 -1 ] 1 3 matrix [ 0x808080 ] vector [ 0 ] vector straight-on projection sunlit fill-solid \ (a corner index past the points)
square [ [ 0 1 2 3 ] ] [ 0 0 10 ] 1 3 matrix [ 0 0 -1 ] 1 3 matrix [ 0x808080 ] vector [ 0 ] vector straight-on [ 10 5 5 ] vector sunlit fill-solid \ (a projection of 3 elements)
square [ [ 0 1 2 3 ] ] [ 0 0 10 ] 1 3 matrix [ 0 0 -1 ] 1 3 matrix [ 0x808080 ] vector [ 0 ] vector straight-on projection fill-solid          \ (too few operands)
